{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Bomb is a one-time use ",["l","打造#Bombs","explosive item"],". It damages certain items within its radius. Other items are impervious to its effects."]],["p",["Bombs can be ",["l","打造","crafted"]," or purchased from the ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"]," (both in the ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"]," and ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],") for 1,000g. They are also offered by the ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"],", who will trade five ",["l","石英","Quartz"]," for one Bomb. ",["l","蝙蝠","Bats"],", ",["l","熔岩蟹","Lava Crab"],"s, ",["l","鱿鱼娃","Squid Kid"],"s, and ",["l","飞蛇","Serpent"],"s can drop Bombs when slain. Ten Bombs may occasionally be found in ",["l","骷髅洞穴#Treasure Rooms","treasure rooms"]," in the Skull Cavern. ",["l","矿井#Crates and Barrels","Crates and barrels"]," in the ",["l","矿井#Difficulty Levels","\"dangerous\" Mines"]," or ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"]," can drop one. 3-5 Bombs may occasionally be found in ",["l","补给箱","Supply Crate"],"s on the ",["l","农场地图#Beach","Beach Farm"]," provided the player has upgraded the ",["l","农舍","Farmhouse"]," exactly once. A Bomb may occasionally be obtained from the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," for 150–1,000g. Five Bombs may be received from opening a ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],". Twelve or fifteen Bombs can be given as a prize from the ",["l","镇长的庄园#Prize Machine","prize machine"]," in the Mayor's Manor. ",["l","肯特","Kent"]," may randomly send one in the mail as a gift."]],["p",["If a player has read the ",["l","矮人安全手册","Dwarvish Safety Manual"],", they will take 25% less damage from a Bomb."]]]],["Effects",2,[["p",["Note that the following is not an exhaustive list:"]],["l",0,[[1,["Rocks and ",["l","采矿#Mining Nodes","ore/gem nodes"]," will drop their respective ores, gems, etc."]],[1,["Mushrooms, ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],"s, and ",["l","矿物#Foraged Minerals","foraged minerals"]," will be destroyed."]],[1,["Any untilled dirt tiles within a significantly smaller radius will become tilled. In ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," and ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],", any items (e.g., ",["l","粘土","clay"],", ",["l","古物","artifacts"],") will be dropped at the same rate as a player using a hoe; elsewhere, nothing will drop (unless the spot in question is the subject of a ",["l","秘密纸条","Secret Note"],")."]],[1,["Crafted ",["l","打造#Artisan Equipment","artisan"]," and ",["l","打造#Refining Equipment","refining"]," equipment will be destroyed."]],[1,[["l","加热器","Heater"],"s will be destroyed."]],[1,[["l","自动采集器","Auto-Grabber"],"s will not be destroyed, whether empty or containing items."]],[1,[["l","树","Trees"]," will be destroyed when their health reaches zero (five Bombs will knock down a fully grown tree, and three more will destroy the stump). Trees will drop ",["l","木材","wood"],", ",["l","树液","sap"],", and any seeds they contained."]]]]]],["Radius",2,[["p",["The Bomb has a radius of 5 (diameter of 11)."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Bomb is not used in any ",["l","收集包","bundles"],"."]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["A Bomb can be used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号#Sewing Machine","Sewing Machine"]," to create the ",["f","Shirt155.png",24]," ",["l","裁缝","Bomber Jacket"],". It can be used as a black ",["l","染色","dye"]," when used in the spool of the ",["l","缝纫机","Sewing Machine"]," with a dyeable clothing item in the feed."]]]],["Quests",2,[["p",["Bomb is not used in any ",["l","任务","quests"],"."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Ore nodes in the ",["l","采石场","Quarry"]," now drop ore instead of ",["l","石头","stone"],". Gem Nodes in the Quarry can be destroyed by bombs. A Bomb can now be used in ",["l","裁缝","Tailoring"],"."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Bombs can now be bought at the shop in the ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"],". Can now be found in ",["l","补给箱","Supply Crate"],"s on the ",["l","农场地图#Beach","Beach Farm"],"."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Bomb price from the Dwarf increased from 600g to 1,000g. Added as possible prize from ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],"es and ",["l","镇长的庄园#Prize Machine","Prize Machine"],". Reading the ",["l","矮人安全手册","Dwarvish Safety Manual"]," will reduce damage to players."]]]]]]],"f":[["Source",["*",["l","打造","Crafting"],"\n*",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],"\n*",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"]," shop\n*Bat (2%)\n*",["l","蝙蝠","Frost Bat (2%)"],"\n*",["l","蝙蝠","Lava Bat (2%)"],"\n*",["l","熔岩蟹","Lava Crab (40%)"],"\n*",["l","飞蛇","Serpent (15%)"],"\n*",["l","鱿鱼娃","Squid Kid (10%)"],"\n*",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]]],["Ingredients",[["i","(O)380","Iron Ore ×4"],["i","(O)382","Coal ×1"]]],["Sell Price",["50g"]]]}